<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Delhi to Goa | Express Enclosed Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for a car shipped from Delhi to Goa?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average door‑to‑door transit time for a vehicle moving from Delhi to Goa is 2 to 3 business days, depending on traffic conditions along NH 19 and weather. Our GPS‑enabled fleet provides live updates, ensuring you can track the exact location of your car throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the zero‑scratch guarantee work during the Delhi‑to‑Goa move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our zero‑scratch guarantee is backed by a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system, hydraulic ramp loading, 4‑wheel lock restraints, and edge‑padding. In the unlikely event of damage, the IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covers the full declared value, giving you complete peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden fees in the Delhi to Goa car transport cost?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No hidden fees are charged. The quoted price includes base freight, hydraulic ramp usage, insurance, GST, and any statutory documentation fees. Optional services such as expedited loading or extra padding are clearly itemised, so you know exactly what you are paying for.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents do I need to provide for RTO clearance when moving my car from Delhi to Goa?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original Registration Certificate (RC), valid insurance copy, Pollution Under‑Control (PUC) certificate, a signed e‑Way bill, and a copy of your ID proof. Our relocation experts can help you prepare and submit these documents to the Goa RTO on your behalf.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I transport a two‑wheeler or a high‑value luxury car on the same service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our fleet includes dedicated two‑wheeler carriers with wheel chocks and high‑tensile ratchet lashings, as well as specialized enclosed trailers for luxury cars. Both are equipped with the same hydraulic ramp, GPS tracking, and zero‑scratch safety protocols.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How do I track my vehicle during the Delhi to Goa journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every truck in our fleet is fitted with satellite GPS that provides real‑time location data. Once your car is loaded, you will receive a tracking link via SMS or email, allowing you to monitor the exact progress of your vehicle until delivery.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
